---
Note on `kim_nguyen_ref/`:
Reference C/C++ programs in `kim_nguyen_ref/` (`MakeLattice.c`, `RoundMatrix.cpp`,
`Mertens_Enum.cpp`, `Extract-h.c`, `Evaluation-h.c`) were authored by Phong Q. Nguyen
(2024) as companion code to S. Kim and P. Q. Nguyen, "On counterexamples to the
Mertens conjecture", and are released in the public domain by their author.
